an the strategy deliver partial value without it?\n2. **YES** → Split into:\n   - **Tier 1**: Independent work (user-facing features OR risk-reduction spikes/validations)\n   - **Tier 2**: Dependency-gated work (blocked by upstream epic)\n3. **NO** → Linear dependencies; external dependency blocks all downstream\n\n## Step 6: Classify Epics\n\nFor each epic, determine:","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b7a3dd601a276d44","agent_id":"a2fe83627be0e5be3","session_id":"77a263a2-290e-4bf2-aaf1-488c79b76973","uuid":"febe3be6-b736-4ab0-9f08-6b33530118fd","timestamp":"2026-10-22T10:43:36.231Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a44c52c8958328af","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-8002 decomposition"}
